  "title": "MCX_BUILTIN:multisrc",
  "description": "Nine simultaneous planar sources launched in a single simulation - 8 tilted 3x3 mm sources arranged in a ring, converging towards a central 10x10 mm source of 4x weight - inside a 60x60x40 homogeneous domain. Demonstrates the multi-source input format where Optode.Source.Pos/Dir/Param1/Param2 each hold an array of per-source vectors; all sources are summed into one fluence volume.",
